#: ../../source/tough-cookie_README.md:124
msgid ""
"_loose_ - boolean - if `true` enable parsing of key-less cookies like "
"`=abc` and `=`, which are not RFC-compliant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tough-cookie_README.md:126
msgid ""
"If options is not an object, it is ignored, which means you can use "
"`Array#map` with it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tough-cookie_README.md:128
msgid ""
"Here's how to process the Set-Cookie header(s) on a node HTTP/HTTPS "
"response:"
msgstr ""

